:: Tree person sleep {"position":"1225,2525","size":"100,100"}
<<set _asteriaRNGTxt to kitsuneRNG(1, 100)>><<if _asteriaRNGTxt lte 25>>You let Asteria sleep. You grab one of the potato sacks and cover her with it... She mumbles <span class="Asteria">"Thanks..."</span> in her sleep.
